  "content": [
    "Current Microsoft account requirements: new Store onboarding free per 2026-10-29 official article; fully registered developer account still required for console activation.",
    "Developer Home, LAN HTTPS :11443, Portal login versus Visual Studio PIN, x64 native package/dependency installation, USB and LocalState paths, backup/removal, retail switching and permanent deactivation.",
    "Search, categories, model-specific file filtering, version/size/SHA-256, package identity, OS minimum, framework identity/publisher/minimum version.",
    "Shared mobile, language loader ?v=3 and animated background integration retained.",
    "Eight additions: RetroArch Xbox One + Series, DOSBox Pure UWP, ScummVM UWP, xemu UWP, legacy Xenia UWP, RetroPass, X-Files and official Kodi21.3 UWP.",
    "Manifest requirements override outdated README dependency counts: RetroPass needs5frameworks; X-Files publishes .NET Core Debug + Runtime dependencies.",
    "Kodi profile uses LocalCache\\Roaming\\Kodi; Xenia games can use LocalCache. Global backup instructions now allow app-specific local-data paths.",
    "DOSBox/xemu limited to source-confirmed Series support; Kodi lists confirmed One support and unconfirmed exact Series support.",
    "Coverage file records SafeExit and unverified alternative assets truthfully; no skipped candidate is presented as a ready download.",
    "Twenty-three real package icons and two credited Microsoft screenshots; no added videos.",
    "Nine new families: Azahar UWP, Cemu UWP, Ymir UWP, DevilutionX, Jazz² Resurrection, OpenLara xb1, SDLPoP UWP, ioQuake3-One and 2 Ship 2 Harkinian UWP.",
    "Game engines & ports category and Unconfirmed model scope filter added. Article scopes include non-framework file scopes so the unconfirmed Dolphin successor remains discoverable. Confirmed model filters do not expose unconfirmed builds.",
    "Ymir is Series-only. Azahar, Cemu and 2ship have verified Xbox UWP evidence but no exact One/Series matrix. OpenLara and ioQuake3 confirm Xbox One-family support; exact Series support remains unconfirmed.",
    "Source-pinned game-data setup covers own Diablo/Hellfire MPQs, Jazz2 Source directory contents, OpenLara Store/no-compression content.zip, distinct Quake III/OpenArena/Elite Force apps and supported own Majora’s Mask ROM.",
    "All 39 earlier files retain their exact paths, source URLs, versions, sizes and SHA-256 values. All 17 new files are archived; no downloaded builds were executed."
  ],
